NexN2 B70 Turbo — NOTICE & Attributions
=======================================

NexN2 B70 Turbo packages, quantizes, optimizes, and serves the Nex-N2-mini
language model on the Intel Arc Pro B70. It is an UNOFFICIAL, community project
and is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Nex-AGI, the Qwen Team
or Alibaba, Intel Corporation, or the llama.cpp / ggml project.

