3. Nex-N2-mini-B70-Turbo-GGUF — quantized derivatives (this project's weights)
   Derivative work of Nex-N2-mini, redistributed under the Apache License,
   Version 2.0 (attribution above preserved per Section 4(c/d)).
   Changes made to the original work (per Apache-2.0 Section 4(b)):
     - Converted from the original safetensors to the GGUF format.
     - Quantized to Q3_K_S / Q3_K_M / Q4_K_M / Q5_K_M / IQ4_XS and dynamic
       mixes using a llama.cpp importance matrix (imatrix).
     - The GGUF metadata `qwen35moe.block_count` and
       `qwen35moe.nextn_predict_layers` were set to 40 and 0 respectively so the
       model loads in llama.cpp. The MTP/NextN head is speculative-only and is
       absent from the published checkpoint; this is lossless for standard
       inference (see docs/methodology.md).
   The model weights are not otherwise altered beyond quantization.

